Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.700
A NASA

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.335
task force is holding

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.704
its first meeting on UFOs.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.372
Public meeting,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.873
I should say UFO owes

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.341
or as the professionals call them,

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.277
you a piece that stands for unidentified

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.214
