00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.148
A group of experts

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.583
who spent nine months studying

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.451
the data on these UAPS.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.153
