00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.641
and they saw against the night sky.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.143
Those three little dots there.

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:43.977
Look at them.

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:45.645
They're moving in concert.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.113
The airplane that spotted them

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.848
said we don't know what that is.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:50.717
They tried to chase it down.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.986
They could not chase it down.

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.287
And this was rolled out today.

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:56.856
And now spoiler alert,

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.358
the NASA's scientists studied this

00:00:58.358 --> 00:00:59.192
and eventually they said

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.293
we put all the evidence together.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.461
What this was, was three

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.296
commercial aircraft

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:05.398
in a typical flight corridor.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.666
The reason they couldn't chase them down

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.768
is because they're much further away.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:10.103
Than they thought.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.271
And they were simply lit up that way.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.705
The movement that you see there,

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:13.573
that's the plane

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.141
taking the pictures over that distance.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:15.442
That's why

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:16.142
it looks like they're

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.644
moving back and forth.

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:19.946
So their point is to say

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.048
there's a lot of stuff out there

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:24.150
